========================================
AsT68 Experiment Summary
========================================
Date: 2026-08-13
Source: register_tiled_gemm_AsT68.cu (copy of accepted source with AsT stride 64→68)
Accepted Baseline: 0.265424 ms (30 samples, same machine)

VERDICT: REJECTED

========================================
